  "plain": "A flying saucer is said to have crashed near Aztec, New Mexico, in 1948, and the researcher Scott Ramsey, who has spent years looking into the case, says he spoke to people who saw it with their own eyes. Listing them for Michels, he names \"Doug Nolan, Ken Farley, the preacher, the preacher's son, one other gentleman.\" If their accounts hold, the Aztec crash would rest on living eyewitnesses and not only on rumour."
